  "applies_to": "Lovato VT1 series drives on the built-in RS-485 port, per communication manual I646 GB I 02 21 (Modbus part).",
  "summary": "The Lovato VT1 is an AC drive whose RS-485 port supports Modbus RTU/ASCII and BACnet MS/TP. Over Modbus a master writes a command word and frequency reference and reads a block of monitor registers. This map covers the command word, frequency command, status and fault code, terminal status, output frequency, voltage, current, power, PID values, analog inputs and drive temperature.",
